                <pb facs="0793" n="717" sameAs="frus:frus1935v02/pg717"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.5231/1015: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Spain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bowers</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-08-17T11:00:00+00:00">August 17, 1935—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received August 17—8:55 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>54. My telegram No. 53, August 14, 2 a.m. Sub-Minister says exchange insurance
                    experimental with four nations and probably will be extended to all others if it
                    works satisfactorily. Originated with Ministry of Finance.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bowers</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
